{"id":"053b08137256a80a","group":"93","path":"93/93-prop-dedekind-dual.md","title":"Dedekind Dual","display":"Dedekind Dual","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-prop-dedekind-dual","aliases":["93-prop-dedekind-dual"],"display":"Dedekind Dual","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-complete-lattice]]","[[58-df-poset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-prop-dedekind-dual"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-prop-dedekind-dual</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Dedekind Dual"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74c997e395e53951\" href=\"?note=74c997e395e53951\" title=\"93-df-complete-lattice\">93-df-complete-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"prop-dedekind-dual-—-Dedekind-Dual\">prop-dedekind-dual — Dedekind Dual</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\)</span> is the partial-order predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Low}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Low}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Up}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Up}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DMCar}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{DMCar}_{93}\\)</span>, the restricted operation graphs <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DMMeet}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{DMMeet}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DMJoin}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{DMJoin}_{93}\\)</span>, the completion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DM}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{DM}_{93}\\)</span>, and the graph <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_{93}\">\\(\\eta_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteLat}_{93}\\)</span> is the complete-lattice predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74c997e395e53951\" href=\"?note=74c997e395e53951\" title=\"93-df-complete-lattice\">93-df-complete-lattice</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Low}_{93}(X;P,R)\\coloneqq\n\\{p\\in P:\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle p,x\\rangle\\in R)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Low}_{93}(X;P,R)\\coloneqq\n\\{p\\in P:\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle p,x\\rangle\\in R)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Up}_{93}(X;P,R)\\coloneqq\n\\{p\\in P:\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,p\\rangle\\in R)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Up}_{93}(X;P,R)\\coloneqq\n\\{p\\in P:\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,p\\rangle\\in R)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DMCar}_{93}(P,R)\\coloneqq\n\\{D\\subseteq P:D=\\operatorname{Low}_{93}(\\operatorname{Up}_{93}(D;P,R);P,R)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DMCar}_{93}(P,R)\\coloneqq\n\\{D\\subseteq P:D=\\operatorname{Low}_{93}(\\operatorname{Up}_{93}(D;P,R);P,R)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DMMeet}_{93}(P,R)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle D,E\\rangle,D\\cap E\\rangle:\nD,E\\in\\operatorname{DMCar}_{93}(P,R)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DMMeet}_{93}(P,R)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle D,E\\rangle,D\\cap E\\rangle:\nD,E\\in\\operatorname{DMCar}_{93}(P,R)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DMJoin}_{93}(P,R)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle D,E\\rangle,\n\\operatorname{Low}_{93}(\\operatorname{Up}_{93}(D\\cup E;P,R);P,R)\n\\right\\rangle:D,E\\in\\operatorname{DMCar}_{93}(P,R)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DMJoin}_{93}(P,R)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle D,E\\rangle,\n\\operatorname{Low}_{93}(\\operatorname{Up}_{93}(D\\cup E;P,R);P,R)\n\\right\\rangle:D,E\\in\\operatorname{DMCar}_{93}(P,R)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DM}_{93}(P,R)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\operatorname{DMCar}_{93}(P,R),\n\\operatorname{DMMeet}_{93}(P,R),\\operatorname{DMJoin}_{93}(P,R)\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DM}_{93}(P,R)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\operatorname{DMCar}_{93}(P,R),\n\\operatorname{DMMeet}_{93}(P,R),\\operatorname{DMJoin}_{93}(P,R)\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\eta_{93}(P,R)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle p,\\operatorname{Low}_{93}(\\{p\\};P,R)\\rangle:p\\in P\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\eta_{93}(P,R)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle p,\\operatorname{Low}_{93}(\\{p\\};P,R)\\rangle:p\\in P\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\to\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{CompleteLat}_{93}(\\operatorname{DM}_{93}(P,R))\n\\land\\eta_{93}(P,R):P\\to\\operatorname{DMCar}_{93}(P,R)\\land\n\\forall p,q\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\eta_{93}(P,R)(p)\\subseteq\\eta_{93}(P,R)(q)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\to\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{CompleteLat}_{93}(\\operatorname{DM}_{93}(P,R))\n\\land\\eta_{93}(P,R):P\\to\\operatorname{DMCar}_{93}(P,R)\\land\n\\forall p,q\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\eta_{93}(P,R)(p)\\subseteq\\eta_{93}(P,R)(q)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The displayed function graphs construct the Dedekind–MacNeille complete lattice and its order embedding from the explicit relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>. Minimality and join/meet density are standard further properties but are not asserted in this atom. For an arbitrary poset it is not meaningful to call <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> a sublattice.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"prop-dedekind-dual-—-Dedekind-Dual","text":"prop-dedekind-dual — Dedekind Dual","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-complete-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"74c997e395e53951","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-complete-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)$ is the partial-order predicate of [[58-df-poset]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-complete-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"74c997e395e53951","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompleteLat}_{93}$ is the complete-lattice predicate of [[93-df-complete-lattice]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Low}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Up}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DMCar}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DMMeet}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DMJoin}